{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/\u52a8\u753b__1_.gif?t=1749039099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/\u533b\u9662\u7ecf\u8425EN.png?t=1749039099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Successfully running your own hospital is the core objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the process, you\u2019ll hire staff (doctors, nurses, receptionists, janitors), treat all kinds of cases (outpatient, inpatient, emergencies), and handle unexpected events (earthquakes, equipment failures, staff fatigue).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By solving problems and expanding your hospital, you\u2019ll enjoy endless fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/\u9ad8\u7ea7\u573a\u666f.gif?t=1749039099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/\u6cbb\u7597\u548c\u75c5\u4ebaEN.png?t=1749039099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build different treatment rooms and hire or train staff with various specialties to handle a wide range of patients:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">psychiatric cases convinced they\u2019re celebrities or game characters, bizarre ailments like enlarged tongues or swollen heads, and even chronic patients requiring long-term hospitalization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/\u75c5\u4eba\u548c\u8bbe\u5907.gif?t=1749039099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/\u534e\u4e3d\u7684\u9662\u533a\u5b9a\u5236EN.png?t=1749039099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Style your hospital any way you like\u2014Japanese, European, vintage\u2014and sprinkle in lavish decorations to create a one-of-a-kind campus. It\u2019s all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/\u5899\u4f53\u5730\u677f.gif?t=1749039099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/\u79d1\u7814\u673a\u6784\u548c\u793e\u533a\u6551\u62a4EN.png?t=1749039099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/\u79d1\u6280.gif?t=1749039099\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By researching new technologies you\u2019ll boost treatment efficiency and resource gathering. As the game progresses, these upgrades will continue to enhance your experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/extras/\u6025\u6551.gif?t=1749039099\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694050?t=1749039099","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694050?t=1749039099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/4bb474929d9fa4e4cff1a803e1bb3248aa06c218/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749039099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694050/4bb474929d9fa4e4cff1a803e1bb3248aa06c218/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749039099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors